  "description": "<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>The Future of Sexual Health</strong></span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">At-home STI testing, stigma-free education, and an engaged community to empower regular sexual self-care.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Who Are We?</strong></span>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We, at Yoxly, believe in supporting education, promoting equality, and taking a proactive rather than a reactive approach. We're building an ecosystem to provide a range of remote sexual health services, designed to give users a personalized experience with more convenience, privacy, accessibility, and control. We're curating an inclusive community of individuals, whilst partnering with other organizations and advocacy groups focused on promoting sexual health.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>What Do We Do?</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Yoxly specialises in providing accurate, fast turnaround, discreet, and convenient at-home STI tests. We understand the importance of staying on top of your sexual health, which is why we offer four different types of test kits. This allows you to choose the kit that best suits your specific circumstances, ensuring a personalised testing experience.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">With Yoxly, you can say goodbye to waiting at clinics and hello to a more accessible way of taking control of your sexual health. Our at-home tests empower you to prioritise your well-being without sacrificing convenience or privacy. We strive to make the testing process seamless and user-friendly, so you can have peace of mind and confidence in your results.</span></p>\r\n</div>",
